      "category_id": "seed-cat-research", "entry_number": 1,
      "content": "<h2>Moon Phases</h2><p>Eight phases, from new moon to waning crescent. Timing anchor for most of the rituals in this vault.</p><ul><li>New moon &mdash; beginnings</li><li>Full moon &mdash; charging</li></ul>",
